<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - APPLIED ESTIMATE RAISED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - APPLIED ESTIMATE RAISED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it raised its fiscal 1997 estimate on Applied Materials Inc to $2.71 a share from $2.50 a share.</p>
<p>-- Raised fiscal 1998 estimate to $4.00 a share from $3.30 a share.</p>
<p>-- Said Applied continues to experience strong demand from U.S. and Taiwanese customers.</p>
<p>-- Believes company's shares offer &quot;meaningful upside opportunity.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Applied gained 7-3/8 to 97-5/8.</p>
</text>
